  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Key idea <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>pi</mi></math>-bond do not participate in hybridisation</p><p>In&nbsp;H&minus;C&equiv;C&minus;C=&minus;H all carbon atoms are in same hybridization state i.e.,&nbsp;sp​&nbsp;hybridized.</p><p>a. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>-</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi>sp</mi></mover><mo>&#8801;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi>sp</mi></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi>sp</mi></mover><mo>&#8801;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi>sp</mi></mover><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></math></p><p>b. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msup><mi>sp</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi>sp</mi></mover><mo>&#8801;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi>sp</mi></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msup><mi>sp</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mover></math></p><p>c. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msup><mi>sp</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></munder><mo>=</mo><munder><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi>sp</mi></munder><mo>=</mo><mover><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msup><mi>sp</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mover></math></p><p>d. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msup><mi>sp</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></munder><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi>CH</mi><mo>-</mo></mrow><msup><mi>sp</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></munder><munder><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi>sp</mi></munder><mo>&#8801;</mo><munder><mi>CH</mi><mi>sp</mi></munder></math></p>"
